; The mouth of the expansion port on the underside of the centre grip. Stood 1 mm
; proud of the face for the reason every dark recess in this project is: a box set
; coplanar with the shell z-fights down to a sliver, and one set fully inside a
; solid body cannot be seen at all.
[sub_resource type="BoxMesh" id="BoxMesh_portmouth"]
size = Vector3(0.03, 0.002, 0.01)

