; The expansion port, on the underside of the centre prong. The prong's bottom
; face is at y = -0.060 and the zone stands 2 mm PROUD of it, which is what puts
; a seated pak's mating face exactly on the shell — see the frame table in any of
; the three pak scenes, all of which are measured against this number.
;
; snap_require narrows it to plugs; retro_controller.gd narrows it again to the
; "n64_pak" group, so a cable end offered here is refused.
[node name="ExpansionPort" parent="." instance=ExtResource("5_snapzone")]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, -0.062, 0.004)
grab_distance = 0.035
snap_require = "controller_plug"

